' UC-FMG-04 — Request Facility Module Change

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|Facility Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access module-change request function;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify authority and facility scope;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present scope/authority denial;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Present current facility module configuration;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
:2.0 Select target module & requested change;
:2.1 Provide request information & supporting reason;

|WAHrden System|
:2.2 Validate request;
if (Outside authorized facility scope?) then (Yes [EF-03])
  :Present scope validation failure;
  kill
elseif (Incomplete or invalid info?) then (Yes [EF-02])
  :Present validation issues & allow revision;
  kill
elseif (Conflicting request/governance?) then (Yes [EF-04])
  :Present configuration-conflict result;
  kill
else (Valid)
  :3.0 Present proposed request for review;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
if (Confirm submission?) then (No / Cancel [EF-05])
  :Cancel request submission;
  kill
else (Yes [3.1])
  :Confirm submission;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Save module-change request in 'Pending' state;
if (Save succeeded?) then (No [EF-06])
  :Present submission processing failure;
  kill
else (Yes)
  |Database / Audit|
  :4.1 Record submitted request & audit trail;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :4.2 Present Pending request confirmation;
endif

|Facility Administrator|
:Acknowledge submission confirmation;
stop
@enduml
